@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Stack-safe local effect evaluation: two typed continuation machines

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #495057
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "represented return expression\nAST · DFG · resolved call" as ROOT #DBE4FF
component "parameter-dependence machine\nEnter · Visit · Combine · Exit" as DEP #FFF3BF
component "constant-evaluation machine\nEnter · Join · Binary · Unary · Forward · Exit" as CONST #C5F6FA
component "typed frame stack\n+ intermediate value stack" as FRAMES #E5DBFF
component "active-path set\ncycle semantics" as PATH #FFE8CC
component "terminal-only cache\nentry work still charged" as CACHE #D3F9D8
component "TraversalBudget\nlogical depth · node-entry work" as BUDGET #C3FAE8
component "parameter mask\nordered child OR" as MASK #FFD8A8
component "constant lattice\nbottom · exact · overdefined" as LATTICE #FCC2D7
component "fail-closed output\ncapped · all bits · overdefined" as WIDEN #FFE3E3

ROOT --> DEP : parameter-return evidence
ROOT --> CONST : scalar-return evidence
DEP --> FRAMES : push/pop typed continuations
CONST --> FRAMES : push/pop typed continuations
DEP --> PATH : enter / exit node
CONST --> PATH : enter / exit node
DEP --> CACHE : terminal mask only
CONST --> CACHE : terminal lattice value only
DEP --> BUDGET : charge Enter(depth)
CONST --> BUDGET : charge Enter(depth)
DEP --> MASK : deterministic AST/DFG/call order
CONST --> LATTICE : checked SCCP folds and joins
PATH --> WIDEN : dependency cycle
BUDGET --> WIDEN : logical cap exhausted
FRAMES --> WIDEN : allocation failure

note bottom of FRAMES
  Every suspended child evaluation is data on the heap.
  Native call depth is constant as represented depth grows.
end note

note bottom of PATH
  Dependency cycle -> all bits + capped.
  Constant cycle -> overdefined, no fabricated cap.
end note

note bottom of BUDGET
  max_call_depth is semantic path policy.
  max_worklist_steps is charged node entries.
  Neither configures thread-stack size.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| typed CPG input |
|<#FFF3BF>| dependence continuation machine |
|<#C5F6FA>| constant continuation machine |
|<#E5DBFF>| explicit heap continuation/value state |
|<#FFE8CC>| active-path cycle state |
|<#D3F9D8>| context-independent terminal cache |
|<#C3FAE8>| logical resource accounting |
|<#FFD8A8>| parameter-return result |
|<#FCC2D7>| constant-lattice result |
|<#FFE3E3>| visible conservative failure |
endlegend
@enduml
